# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# What's public: the framework + the clean source lists.
# What's private: your voice, your annotations, your material.
#
# The convention: `*.template.md` is tracked, the working copy is not.
# Run `./scripts/init.sh` after cloning to create working copies.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Your codified voice — the most personal thing here, and the actual engine.
# Templates are tracked; these filled-in versions are not.
voice/style-guide.md
voice/voice-guide.md
voice/content-lessons.md

# Your annotations on the source lists — ⚡ marks and Read: notes are private
# editorial judgments about named people. The clean lists stay public.
sources/*.local.md

# Your raw material and output.
inputs/*
!inputs/README.md

drafts/*
!drafts/.gitkeep

published/*
!published/.gitkeep

# Unpublished ideas and their sources.
vault/ideas.md

# ─── Generated / pulled data — all private, all regenerable from an ID ───
# The scripts ARE the machinery; these are just their output for one account.
# Anyone who clones runs the scripts with their own ID to regenerate all of it.

# Your own pulled content
me.json

# Pulled creator content (小红书 / X / Substack)
creators/
creators_x/
creators_sub/

# All AI analyses (per-account + landscapes) and their digests
analysis/

# Discovery output + generated vault ideas
xhs_authors.json
vault/vault.json

# Generated voice profile (bootstrapped from your posts)
voice/voice.json

# Dashboard data files (generated by build_dashboard.mjs; index.html is tracked)
dashboard/data.js
dashboard/me.js

.DS_Store
.env
.env.local
*.local

# Local Claude Code settings
.claude/settings.local.json

# Design reference images — local only, never commit
dashboard.png
*.reference.png

# User-dropped reference images — local only
IMG_*.JPG
IMG_*.jpg
IMG_*.jpeg
IMG_*.png
IMG_*.PNG
IMG_*.JPEG
IMG_* *.JPG

# Personal deliverables (your specific content)
docs/口播稿.md
docs/*.script.md
